            "CLR via C#, 4th Edition - Chapter 18, \"Custom Attributes\" (sections \"Using Custom Attributes\", \"Defining Your Own Attribute Class\", \"Detecting the Use of a Custom Attribute\"); Chapter 23, \"Assembly Loading and Reflection\" (sections \"Reflection Performance\", \"Discovering a Type's Members\", \"Using Binding Handles to Reduce Your Process's Memory Consumption\").",
            [
                new("Reflection in .NET", "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/fundamentals/reflection/reflection"),
